<p>Charles Edward V. Draper was born October 18, 1855 at Phelps, N.Y., the son of Valney V. and Elizabeth (Sherrell) Draper. The family moved to Marshalltown, Iowa when he was eight years old. Charles attended grade and high school there. His father was a merchant/tailor. The family also ran a boarding house. Tenants included both Tabitha Rice and her brother Ezekiel, a lawyer, also from New York.</p>

